# Spect-IT

- The live product is `website/` (static HTML/CSS/JS). `apps/web` is not what spect-it.com serves.
- Frame every patient result as **screening**, not a diagnosis or final prescription.
- Never add fake checkout, fake payment redirects, or retailer web scraping.
- Deploy the live site with `vercel --prod` from `website/` (project `spect-it-app1`).
- Do not commit `supabase/.temp/*` or secrets (`.env`, API keys).
